MetACCEL-DOS/286/386
  Add support for hardware accelerated SuperVGA's
  No TSR's, No Pop-ups and No Royalties
  List Price: $349     With Source Code: $799 

MetACCEL provides a set of enhanced graphic
display drivers for use with MetaWINDOW graphic
libraries.   MetACCEL adds expanded support for
hardware accelerated SuperVGA's such as S3 based
cards including: Orchid Fahrenheit-1280, Diamond
Stealth, Actrix Graphics Engine, plus IBM 8514
and ATI Graphics Ultra.  MetACCEL with a hardware
accelerated card boosts graphics performance more
than 5 to 15 times over the speed of standard
software programmed SuperVGA's. MetACCEL includes
libraries for DOS, plus both 286 and 386
protected-mode.

MetACCEL works with compilers and DOS extenders
compatible with MetaWINDOW for DOS, 286 and 386
(see above).

